<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-size-adjust: 100%; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin-bottom: 1em;"><font color="#333333" face="Helvetica Neue, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" size="4">{!Lead.FirstName},</font></p><div style="font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div id="bloop_customfont" style=""><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Glad we could connect today!</span><span style="background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font-family: HelveticaNeue;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font-family: HelveticaNeue;">As a follow up to our call, I wanted to provide you with more in-depth&nbsp;information about our company.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: inherit; font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Hopefully, this will give you a better overview about Memphis Invest, and allow you to make an informed decision as to whether we are the right company to help you achieve your passive investment goals.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue; font-size: 18px;">I have attached a pdf called, "<strong>Memphis Invest Critical Numbers</strong>", which gives a high level overview of our&nbsp;portfolio and its performance to date.</span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue; font-size: 18px;">I have also attached another pdf called, "<strong>Memphis Invest Property Data</strong>”. This gives you&nbsp;property specific&nbsp;information on each market that defines the average price points and rents.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">This will also help give you a better understanding of the type of properties you can add to you&nbsp;portfolio.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">On our phone call we&nbsp;discussed a high level&nbsp;overview about Memphis Invest, as well as your specific passive investment goals so, I wanted&nbsp;&nbsp;to go a little more in depth.</span></span></p><p style="font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: HelveticaNeue;">I’m attaching a link to&nbsp;our&nbsp;</span><strong style=""><span style="border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;"><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/passive-investment-jumpstart-packet-content-2-0" style=""><font color="#3366ff">Quick Start Package</font></a></span></strong><font color="#333333">&nbsp;that has (</font><strong style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">12</strong><font color="#333333">)&nbsp;</font></span><span style="color: inherit; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent;">2-4 minute&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: inherit; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent;">videos</strong><span style="color: inherit; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;answering the&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: inherit; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent;">top questions</strong><span style="color: inherit; font-size: 18px; background-color: transparent;">&nbsp;(most) investors ask.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">There will be plenty of content here to help you learn more about our company as you continue doing your due diligence.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Lastly, I’m attaching a link to current&nbsp;investor&nbsp;</span><strong style=""><a href="http://info.memphisinvest.com/real-heroes" style=""><font color="#3366ff"><span style="border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;">testimonials</span>.</font></a></strong><font color="#333333">&nbsp;This will give you a&nbsp;</font><strong style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51);">REAL</strong><font color="#333333">&nbsp;look at what our clients say about Memphis Invest, and their passive investment journey.</font><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: HelveticaNeue;">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Now, I know I have given you a lot of information</span><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">…</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Take some time to review it and write down any questions you might have so we can discuss it in detail on our next call...</span>&nbsp;[insert appt date and time]&nbsp;</span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Looking&nbsp;</span><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">forward to connecting with you soon!&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Talk soon,</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><span face="HelveticaNeue" style="font-family: HelveticaNeue;">Joshua</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></p><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><br></a></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><span style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><img src="https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hub/44341/hubfs/Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20without%20banner.png?t=1509636987367&amp;width=600&amp;name=Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20without%20banner.png" alt="Email signature - final - without banner.png" width="600" title="Email signature - final - without banner.png" caption="false" data-constrained="true" style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 600px;"></a></span></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P ">&nbsp;</a></div><div style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px;"><span style="text-size-adjust: 100%; border-bottom-width: initial; border-bottom-color: initial;"><a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/HFY5P "><img src="https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hub/44341/hubfs/Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20banner%20only.png?t=1509636987367&amp;width=600&amp;name=Email%20signature%20-%20final%20-%20banner%20only.png" alt="Email signature - final - banner only.png" width="600" title="Email signature - final - banner only.png" caption="false" data-constrained="true" style="vertical-align: bottom; width: 600px;"></a></span></div><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12px; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><br></p><p style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-size-adjust: 100%; margin-bottom: 1em;"><br></p></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div class="gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><div><font size="1" style="font-family: verdana, sans-serif;"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
